    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきく　くちを　あけて　じぶんの\nつよさを　アピール。たいりょうの\nすなを　まきあげて　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "크게 입을 벌려 자신의\n강함을 어필한다. 대량의\n모래를 일으켜 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il exhibe sa force en ouvrant grand sa mâchoire,\net attaque en soulevant des tornades de sable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Das weit aufgerissene Maul demonstriert seine\nStärke. Es attackiert mit gebündeltem Sand.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hace gala de su fuerza abriendo su enorme boca.\nPara atacar levanta gran cantidad de arena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mostra la propria forza spalancando le fauci.\nAttacca sollevando immani quantità di sabbia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of\nfearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand\nwhile attacking.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きく　口を　開けて\n自分の　強さを　アピール。\n大量の　砂を　巻き上げて　攻撃する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hace gala de su fuerza abriendo su enorme boca.\nPara atacar levanta gran cantidad de arena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないに　ためた　すなを　からだの\nあなから　ふきあげて　きょだいな\nたつまきを　つくり　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내에 모아둔 모래를 몸의\n구멍에서 뿜어 올려 거대한\n회오리를 만들어 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il emmagasine du sable qu’il expulse en tornades par\nles pores de sa peau pour attaquer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wirbelt im Körper gespeicherten Sand durch\nÖffnungen und generiert so einen Sandwirbelsturm.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando ataca, expulsa arena almacenada en su interior\npara crear un gran tornado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Immagazzina sabbia all’interno del corpo e l’espelle\ncon violenza dai pori, formando enormi vortici.",
